### Performance Test API - Parallel Insert to Multiple Tables

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/performancetest

###
# Test 1: Insert 100k records vào 1 bảng (TongHopKcb)
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=1&recordsPerTable=100000&batchSize=1000
Content-Type: application/json

###
# Test 2: Insert 100k records song song vào 2 bảng (TongHopKcb + TongHopKcb1)
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=2&recordsPerTable=100000&batchSize=1000
Content-Type: application/json

###
# Test 3: Insert 100k records song song vào 5 bảng
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=5&recordsPerTable=100000&batchSize=1000
Content-Type: application/json

###
# Test 4: Insert 100k records song song vào 10 bảng
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=10&recordsPerTable=100000&batchSize=1000
Content-Type: application/json

###
# Test 5: Insert 100k records song song vào 15 bảng (FULL TEST)
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=15&recordsPerTable=100000&batchSize=1000
Content-Type: application/json

###
# Test 6: Quick test - 10k records vào 3 bảng
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=3&recordsPerTable=10000&batchSize=1000
Content-Type: application/json

###
# Test 7: Large batch size test - 100k records, batch size 5000
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=1&recordsPerTable=100000&batchSize=5000
Content-Type: application/json

###
# Test 8: Small batch size test - 100k records, batch size 500
POST {{apiUrl}}/insert-parallel?tableCount=1&recordsPerTable=100000&batchSize=500
Content-Type: application/json
